WEBVTT

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.700
We call this the Bushi punishment!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:31.420
Bushi

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:32.810
Tamegoro-kun forgot his homework, so he
has to stand in front of everyone like this!

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:36.180
Ew, he's got a katana!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.140
How lame!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.220
Bushi are all trash, right?

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.840
Total trash!

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:46.020
Kojiro, Age 6

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.440
It's a Kishin!

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:25.670
A mighty Kishin is descending!

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:43.050
We're finally making good on that
promise from five years ago!

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:42.090
Bushi's
Pride

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.360
We're gonna form the
strongest Bushi band ever!

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:47.800
Yeah!

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:53.270
It's gonna be awesome, huh, Kojiro?

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.220
Yeah...

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.760
What's wrong, Kojiro?

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:57.920
Nothing...

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.070
Come on, man, it's gonna
bug me now. What is it?

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:03.250
I just... don't care that much.

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.950
Don't care about what?

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:10.340
I mean, I've always wanted
to get out of town.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:13.420
But this about becoming
a Bushi and slaying oni...

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:15.340
I'd forgotten about all that.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:19.770
Say what you will about Bushi being heroes
or whatever. It just doesn't click for me.

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.120
What are you saying, man?!

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:26.980
With our swords together,
we're gonna make a name for ourselves!

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:30.340
Trust me. Swords aren't that great.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:31.890
Kojiro?

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:37.300
Anyway, I'm saying I don't really care
about all this Bushi and oni stuff.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:41.730
Don't you worry.
Once you get into it, you'll get it for sure.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:43.430
Get what?

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:46.130
There it is!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:46.980
Right!

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.830
That's a Kishin?

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.940
Kinda small for a boss.

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.510
Stay on your toes.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:59.460
I know!

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.190
That's it? That was easy.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:16.840
No...

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.150
It's not over yet.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:28.490
It revived!

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:32.450
How're we supposed to beat that thing?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.140
O mighty Kishin!

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:39.140
We have an offering for you!

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:41.650
Please, help yourself!

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:54.890
The oni from before were
eating the same stuff...

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.280
Look!

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.750
It... It...

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.480
It's huge!

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:21.710
Kishin
Engoku Tengu

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.300
O mighty Kishin!

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.030
Please, quell your anger!

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:50.750
The great Kishin!

00:05:51.920 --> 00:05:56.860
For the first time in five years,
he has assumed his true form!

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:05.850
So <i>that's</i> a Kishin...?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:11.520
He's too huge to even consider fighting.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:14.300
Musashi, we need to get out of here.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.740
Musashi?!

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.730
He's going to eat us!

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.490
Is he... after my katana?

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.200
The great Kishin eats swords!

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.450
Hurry up and let go of it!

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:38.900
Let go of my sword?

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:45.430
Kojiro...

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:10.460
Why won't he just let go of that thing?

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:14.400
Beats me! Who knows what
goes through a Bushi's head?

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.270
Kojiro!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.750
I hated it for so long.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:30.680
This stupid sword...

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:33.420
This stupid sword!

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:40.440
I've had enough of it!

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:45.530
Why do we have to be Bushi?

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:48.520
Kojiro.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.940
Father...

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:01.970
Come with me.
I've got a secret to tell you.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.320
Listen well, Kojiro. Oni are monsters.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.050
They're the furthest thing from loving gods.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:19.340
And there's only one force that stands
against them... That's the Bushi.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:20.860
The Bushi?

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:25.910
That's right. Like our ancestors.

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:30.450
I'm sorry.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:36.550
I know you've suffered because
of your Bushi blood.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.420
It's not your fault, Father.

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:40.800
But I want you to know...

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:43.870
After everyone else in this country
cast aside their pride

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.370
and gave up on resisting the oni,

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:52.580
the Bushi continued to fight
for people's place in this world.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.340
It's their way of life.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:09:00.060
Kojiro... you're not trash.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:04.030
You're the descendant of a proud,
courageous bloodline.

00:09:05.530 --> 00:09:07.340
Don't ever forget that.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:10.310
Yes, Father.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:14.410
I wanted to get rid of it.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.460
But now...

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:21.940
Kojiro, a katana is a Bushi's pride.

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:24.520
Don't lose yours.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:33.070
A katana is a Bushi's pride...?

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:39.390
If I let go of it...

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:44.520
it feels like...

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:48.230
I'd be losing something important!

00:09:48.590 --> 00:09:50.850
One! Two!

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.430
Three! Four!

00:09:55.390 --> 00:10:01.770
Father, why does it feel so right
when I swing a sword?

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:06.340
That's because you've got
Bushi blood in your veins.

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:10.200
So I'm never gonna let go!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:24.170
Drop it! It's mine!

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:48.980
You okay, buddy?!

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:52.440
Aw, he ate it.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.020
Man, who cares?

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:56.930
What difference does a sword or two make?

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:02.130
Kojiro, a katana is a Bushi's pride.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:04.710
Don't lose yours.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.780
Dammit...

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:09.470
Dammit.

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:14.120
Dammit!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:23.700
Dammit...

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:29.190
Okay, Kojiro, time for sword practice!

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:32.460
Don't waltz in here like it's your house!

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:38.240
Looks like you've got a friend in training.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.330
He's just some weirdo.

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.310
What's your name?

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:45.170
Musashi?!

00:11:58.370 --> 00:11:59.570
Hup...

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.660
What is he doing?

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:13.610
Should be in here.

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:17.390
Don't tell me...

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.970
Fool! Do not disturb the
mighty Kishin's meal!

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:43.070
His meal?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:46.840
That katana belongs to Kojiro, dammit.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:51.300
Who said you could stick
it in your nasty gut?!

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.090
A mighty Kishin just screamed...

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.310
This isn't good! If that breaks...

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:06.880
It's fine. There's no way
he could break it alone.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.000
Musashi...

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:12.930
Mighty Kishin! If you were
to damage it yourself...

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.480
You must calm your rage!

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:21.630
How about this?!

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:33.870
Musashi!

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.130
Musashi...

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:52.230
The fool! Now he's paid for defying a Kishin!

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:31.630
Here you go.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.710
You dropped this.

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:42.380
Thank you.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:47.080
This is... really important to me.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:52.200
I knew how much it mattered to you.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.330
Don't lose it again, okay?

00:14:56.740 --> 00:15:00.790
Kojiro, a katana is a Bushi's pride.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.470
Don't lose yours.

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:06.580
What really matters to me...

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:09.880
The thing I couldn't bear to lose...

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.850
You understood all along, huh?

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:18.070
What a relief, right?

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:22.180
After grasping this, I think I get it.

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:26.140
A katana is the embodiment a Bushi's pride.

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:32.000
And a Bushi's job is to slay oni, right?

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:35.400
You ready to do this, Kojiro?

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:40.140
Yeah, let's make the strongest Bushi band!
And we'll do it together!

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.530
You bet we will!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:48.930
This red Kishin is gonna be
our first real achievement.

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:49.590
Yeah.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.350
I'm stoked.

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:54.860
We're taking the first big step
to making our dream come true!

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:57.800
I don't know about that...

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:03.260
But maybe it'll help me understand what
a Bushi's pride is all about.

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.910
We've got trouble!
Fortress spotted at eight o' clock!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.690
It's a Bushi band!
A band of Bushi is attacking!

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:13.570
A band of Bushi?

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.330
Who are those guys?!

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.820
Wh-Who the—

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:14.470
It's Takeda!

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:16.660
The Takeda Band is here!

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.680
Wh-What the—

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:25.740
Didn't he say they were Bushi band?

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:30.250
Hinomoto is under oni control.

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:36.880
There's only one force fighting them
to reclaim this land for humanity.

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:40.580
They're known...

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:45.960
as bands of Bushi!

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:51.670
They're using their swords to fly...

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:54.360
So this is a Bushi band...

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.120
You boys.

00:17:57.330 --> 00:18:00.560
This is way too dangerous
for kids. Clear on out.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:05.500
We're not kids. We're Bushi, too.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:10.150
We're the ones who beat that Kishin
by opening up its belly!

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:12.220
You cut open its belly?

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:14.870
Yeah!

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:19.340
And you think that's enough to beat it?

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.810
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:40.380
A little hole in the gut
isn't going to kill a Kishin.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:46.820
No sweat, though. We'll make sure
to take care of it for you.

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:48.900
Run along to safety now.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.610
Have the miners evacuate upwind!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.280
The enemy's gonna be out for blood!

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:57.190
They said to get clear, Musashi.

00:18:57.920 --> 00:18:58.740
Musashi?

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.530
It can shoot fire, too?!

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:16.630
That Bushi was right! We'd better
get outta here if we don't wanna die!

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:18.250
Musashi!

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:21.660
What're you standing around for?!
Get a move on!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.640
We need to back off this time!

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:26.930
It was supposed to be our first prize...

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.880
What? What are you talking about?

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:35.660
Look. They're gonna steal
our accomplishment.

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:47.440
You're gonna burn up!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.700
I'd take that over letting them
steal this from me!

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:59.760
That thing is supposed to be the first step
to making our childhood dream come true!

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:02.100
That's why...

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:05.550
I'm willing to risk to my life to get it!

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:07.010
Send the nekomata oni!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:13.810
Out of the way!

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:22.470
Why would you go so far?

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:31.710
That's one feisty miner.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.320
You sure he's not a Bushi
from some other band?

00:20:34.320 --> 00:20:37.420
Nah. He fights way too wild to be a Bushi.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:42.130
That said, there's some proper
technique mixed in there, too...

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.160
What a weirdo.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.880
Hey, he's back! Captain!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.340
We were able to locate its core.

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:51.320
It's time to take Engoku Tengu down.

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.180
Yeah!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:54.490
Oh?

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:59.220
That's that kid I told to evacuate.

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:03.730
You're exposing yourself
to too much risk, Captain.

00:21:03.730 --> 00:21:06.290
They're just farmers from Aki. Ignore them.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.190
There's no need for an evacuation.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:10.230
Yes, there is.

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:13.310
What's the point of slaying the Kishin

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:17.090
if we can't save the people here?

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:22.340
Bushi bands are supposed to take the
world back from the oni, aren't we?

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:28.010
Captain of the Takeda Band
Takeda Naotora

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.230
You said it!

00:21:24.570 --> 00:21:28.020
That's our Captain Naotora for you!

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:34.970
I'll have to be satisfied with praying that
your idealism doesn't get you killed.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:36.150
Yep!

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:41.750
I wonder if that kid has something
he's risking his own life for...

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:48.050
If so, he's my kind of idiot!

00:21:50.130 --> 00:21:52.320
Prepare for Crane Wings in the Blue Sky!

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:54.190
Sir!

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:27.270
The Takeda Band was so cool!

00:23:27.270 --> 00:23:30.670
You mean those guys who tried to steal
our kill without so much as an introduction?

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:32.480
I'm Takeda Naotora of the Takeda Band!

00:23:32.480 --> 00:23:33.660
I'm Sanada Aoshi!

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:34.990
Yamamoto Shunrai!

00:23:34.990 --> 00:23:37.590
Now you know who we are!
Will you stop whining about losing a kill?

00:23:37.590 --> 00:23:39.870
That wasn't really the point!

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:39.970
Next Time
The Outside World
